meta {
  name: 17. Cleanup - Delete DataSet
  type: http
  seq: 17
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/datasets/:id
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  id: {{sagaDataSetId}}
}

docs {
  ## Cleanup – Delete DataSet

  **Precondition:** `sagaDataSetId` is set; dataset is not in `AVAILABLE` state (unpublished in step 16).

  **Expected Response**
  - Status: `204 No Content`

  **System Impact**

  | System | Expected Change |
  |---|---|
  | Backend | DataSet record removed from `portal_backend` DB |
}
